            "title": "Boaster Stays With FNATIC for Another Year in 2026 VALORANT Season - Shane the Gamer",
            "published_at": "Wed, 29 Oct 2025 07:00:00 GMT",
            "source": "Shane the Gamer",
            "google_news_url": "https://news.google.com/rss/articles/CBMihwFBVV95cUxOQzA1VmVrU2tkQmdNNlRrZ0tBTGVWN2tIVFFqLTRSYVZ0R3I5dWxxMkZCWkFUS3pweUpJQlFtXzAyV2lMeFc3QmlmdjREU1doc2RmbDdrTHJlcUFOZjVhT0ZNd08zQkk1TlhacFpkaHJNR2pabEVqaWFJMDlaX3dyN0RhVUdBcjQ?oc=5",
            "article_url": "https://www.shanethegamer.com/esports-news/boaster-resigns-fnatic-valorant-2026/",
            "query_players": [
                "Boaster"
            ],
            "matched_players": [
