            "article_id": "403a02617f0470ad",
            "title": "VALORANT 2025 Act 2 Battle Pass: Exclusive Skins, Launch Date, and Cost Breakdown - VPEsports",
            "published_at": "Wed, 05 Mar 2025 08:00:00 GMT",
            "source": "VPEsports",
            "google_news_url": "https://news.google.com/rss/articles/CBMioAFBVV95cUxQa1E2SkgtQnVaM01MNGRpZkUzZGNjUjV5Uk1RLTRsS2lFdDF4MHZWWEFBNlVOSlhEMnJ5UmtFcUpMN1FhTXM1dkhlTFFLMnZEM3ZSVW43Z0xJaTZOeE9xa1I5QjdUVXZEUE9DZm5FSGJENFcxQ1ItZkc5MkRQNjhWWmhjLW1Wa0QyNHVYcVYyaEhUcTFMdlJDU2Mwb2xZdWJ6?oc=5",
            "article_url": "https://vpesports.com/valorant-season-2025-act-2-battle-pass-skins-release-date-and-pricing-details",
            "query_players": [
                "BuZz"
            ],
            "matched_players": [
                "BuZz",
                "Life",
                "something",
                "YOU"
            ],
            "content": "As VALORANT continues to evolve, the excitement builds with the arrival of the Season 2025 Act 2 Battle Pass, set to launch on March 5, 2025. This new Battle Pass will introduce a variety of exclusive skins and items that players can use in matches, enhancing both gameplay and aesthetics. Players can unlock these rewards by engaging in matches and completing straightforward missions, making it accessible for everyone. The Battle Pass promises a mix of both free and premium rewards, catering to all types of players.\nStay tuned for more details on the skins, the overall theme for this season, and other exciting features that will come with the new patch update. Whether you’re a seasoned veteran or a newcomer, the Season 2025 Act 2 Battle Pass offers plenty to look forward to as you dive into the action-packed world of VALORANT. Make sure to mark your calendars and gear up for an exhilarating gaming experience!\nTable of Contents\nThe upcoming VALORANT Season 2025 Act 2 Battle Pass is set to create a buzz among players, with its availability timed differently based on your location. For players in the US and Europe, the Battle Pass will officially launch on March 5, 2025. However, for those situated in regions further east, such as Asia and Australia, the release will be on March 6. This staggered rollout allows players across the globe to join in on the excitement almost simultaneously.\nBelow is the detailed release schedule by time zone:\n- US (West Coast): March 5, 2025, at 6 AM PT\n- US (East Coast): March 5, 2025, at 9 AM ET\n- Brazil: March 5, 2025, at 10 AM\n- Europe: March 6, 2025, at 5 AM CET\n- UK: March 6, 2025, at 4 AM GMT\n- India: March 6, 2025, at 2:30 AM IST\n- Korea and Japan: March 6, 2025, at 6 AM KST/JST\n- China (Beijing): March 6, 2025, at 5 AM CST\nIn addition to the Battle Pass, players can look forward to the introduction of a new VALORANT Agent named Waylay, who will join the roster with unique abilities, adding fresh dynamics to gameplay.\nThis season’s Battle Pass offers a rich selection of rewards, divided into free and paid tiers, ensuring there’s something for everyone. Here’s a breakdown of what you can expect:\nFree Rewards:\n- Byteshift Ghost: A sleek weapon skin that adds a modern touch to your arsenal.\n- They Won’t Know Spray: An amusing spray to express your in-game personality.\n- Sloth Tactics Buddy: A cute companion to accompany you in matches.\nPaid Rewards:\n- Byteshift Vandal: A premium skin for one of the most popular weapons in the game.\n- Refractrix Guardian: A unique design that stands out on the battlefield.\n- Diet Milk Card: A fun card to showcase your style.\n- Kill Contract Spray: Perfect for marking your victories.\n- Heartless Card: A striking design to represent your gameplay.\n- Balisong Brandish Spray (Animated): An eye-catching animated spray.\n- Tactibear Flex: A playful buddy that adds a fun element.\n- Death Stalker Buddy: A menacing companion that fits the theme.\n- Byteshift Knife (Melee): A stylish melee weapon skin.\n- Doom Wing Phantom: A dramatic skin for the Phantom, sure to impress your opponents.\nTo unlock all these fabulous rewards, players will need to purchase the Battle Pass for 1000 VALORANT Points, which is approximately $10. This investment not only grants access to the premium rewards but also enhances your gaming experience with unique skins and items.\nRemember, the launch of the Season 2025 Act 2 Battle Pass means the end of the ongoing VALORANT Episode 10 Act 1 Battle Pass. So, make sure to complete and collect all current rewards before they disappear! This transition marks an exciting time for VALORANT players, as new content always breathes fresh life into the game.\nBe ready to dive into the latest season, equip yourself with new gear, and explore the abilities of Waylay as you strategize and compete. The VALORANT community is buzzing with anticipation, and this Battle Pass promises to deliver the excitement and variety that players crave. Mark your calendars and prepare for an exhilarating gaming experience!",
