            "article_id": "305060abfb8c5471",
            "title": "Paper Rex's PatMen opens up about mental struggles in VCT Pacific Stage 1 - Philstar.com",
            "published_at": "Tue, 13 May 2025 07:00:00 GMT",
            "source": "Philstar.com",
            "google_news_url": "https://news.google.?oc=5",
            "article_url": "https://www.philstar.com/campus/sports/2025/05/13/2442824/paper-rexs-patmen-opens-about-mental-struggles-vct-pacific-stage-1",
            "query_players": [
