            "title": "Vanguard hits new ‘Bans-Per-Second’ record. - VALORANT",
            "published_at": "Tue, 04 Feb 2025 08:00:00 GMT",
            "source": "VALORANT",
            "google_news_url": "https://news.google.com/rss/articles/CBMiiAFBVV95cUxNakc5THBiVjhPMzItT0JWS1JGeUhEcWx5QzVSaTU2Mkd5TnNIc2RRLUJkcXlTVlJuTUJ6SUtQN0hlQWxaVjV1TXA1a2lObmJ6T1doTkFLRWRSaDF6bU5zZEZRb2t3VjlvdVhFX0UyN1U3RnVHclk1QjlIRFREcDBiOU9fQnIyVGlR?oc=5",
            "article_url": "https://playvalorant.com/en-us/news/dev/vanguard-hits-new-bans-per-second-record/",
