            "content": "NAVI esports club has introduced an updated VALORANT roster for VCT 2025: EMEA Stage 2. GianFranco \"koalanoob\" Potestio has been replaced by 19-year-old Alex \"alexiiik\" Hawlasek, previously of Enterprise, GoNext, and Zero Tenacity.\nOver the past two years, alexiiik has twice become the VALORANT Challengers 2024 East champion and twice finished second. His most recent significant achievement was silver at VALORANT Challengers 2025 NORTH//EAST: Stage 2.\nWe are excited to welcome Alex to NAVI and are looking forward to the start of VCT 2025: EMEA Stage 2. The new season for Born to Win will begin with a match against Apeks scheduled for July 16 at 18:00.\nNAVI VALORANT roster:\nKyrylo \"ANGE1\" Karasov\nEmirhan \"hiro\" Kat\nUğur \"Ruxic\" Güç\nAlex \"alexiiik\"Hawlasek\nAndrei \"Shao\" Kiprskii\nVincent \"Happy\" Schopenhauer (coach)\nDmytro \"chippy\" Bychenko (assistant coach)\nZuzanna \"Shiji_mm\" Hejduk-Mostowy (perfomance coach)\nMykhailo \"m1ke\" Palamar (manager)",
