            "title": "Gen.G, DRX and Nongshim RedForce Face Crucial Showdowns in VCT Pacific Stage 2 - Inven Global",
            "published_at": "Thu, 24 Jul 2025 07:00:00 GMT",
            "source": "Inven Global",
            "google_news_url": "https://news.google.com/rss/articles/CBMixgFBVV95cUxNenhYRXNZejdabkI3SGtUVF9mMnY4cDFSeVgyNWw5N1Atb3NCR0Ixc01IZkJNNkV4VlZpYXhPWU9XX1Y1czhoazlCNmV0Y3BrSXhSNW5zS2pSYURVRTRKOUFHTlpSQTVGYVAwclh2Z3BCZDltWGtQQlJkc09lX2ljc0czWGR3N19sMUMySUdiX2hnLXAyT2I4eUNDODhRd1FKUmQtZkNENGtZVXA3dXJxdG85WFFmTkgtOXBkQkgyQzBKdmxKd2c?oc=5",
            "article_url": "https://www.invenglobal.com/articles/19499/geng-drx-and-nongshim-redforce-face-crucial-showdowns-in-vct-pacific-stage%E2%80%AF2",
            "query_players": [
