                "spike",
                "YOU"
            ],
            "content": "VALORANT at Comic Con Stockholm\nRiot Games heading to Comic Con Stockholm to celebrate the Nordic community\nStockholm, Monday May 19: Today, Riot Games is pleased to announce that they will be bringing VALORANT to Comic Con Stockholm for the first time, as well as sponsoring the Comic Con Summer GameHub, from May 31 – June 1.\nThis appearance is part of Riot Games’ ongoing commitment to supporting their community and gaming events in the Nordics. As Scandinavia’s premier geek and pop culture convention, Comic Con Stockholm is the perfect stage for Riot Games to welcome fans from across the region for two action-packed days celebrating all things VALORANT.\nWith VALORANT’s fifth anniversary fast approaching, there’s never been a better time for Nordic players to rally their friends and head to Stockholm’s Kistamässan for the ultimate VALORANT experience.\nAt the Riot Games booth at Comic Con Stockholm, fans can expect:\n- VALORANT photo opportunities \n- Riot Games cosplay meetup on Saturday \n- PC Bang hosting VALORANT matches \n- Defuse the Spike challenge \nFrom shadowy duelists to high-tech tacticians, VALORANT’s diverse roster of agents continues to inspire fans and creators alike. Whether you're a seasoned cosplay veteran or debuting your very first costume, fans are invited to showcase their creations at the Riot Games booth—located front and center at D.06 in the convention hall.\nFans will be able to celebrate their favorite game in style, with VALORANT-themed photo opportunities running throughout the weekend and a special cosplay meetup on Saturday hosted by cosplayer Laura Craft.\nVALORANT enthusiasts can also put their skills to the test in the real-life Defuse the Spike challenge. In this high-stakes experience, players must solve a series of puzzles against the clock to successfully defuse the iconic Spike and win exclusive prizes.\nThe booth will also feature a fully-equipped Riot Games PC Bang, complete with 10 gaming stations ready for VALORANT. Open to all skill levels and completely free, the PC Bang operates on a first-come, first-served basis—so be sure to drop by and get in on the action.\nTo join in on the fun with Riot Games at Comic Con Stockholm, head to booth D.06 at the Comic Con Summer GameHub.\nFollow VALORANT on X for more information closer to the event.",
