            "title": "Jemkin: “Maybe players losing confidence or something… I don’t know, just not playing like we used to” – VCT Pacific Stage 2 Interview - Hotspawn",
            "published_at": "Thu, 17 Jul 2025 07:00:00 GMT",
            "source": "Hotspawn",
            "google_news_url": "https://news.google.com/rss/articles/CBMigAFBVV95cUxQWURHRDZoeFZITndLbjZ4RmlFVTNERlpuVEJRSUtoZ2ItMUMyRTJPUVZoLUJrWlVIVFEwLTFIUnhDQnZVbGo3UnY5akFmX3J5YVo4a0RuSUw3M3p5U3ZCbGZaVWhOSHFZSzg5cnBUVjVyVGRpWjYxTFZ3WVFJbWk0OQ?oc=5",
            "article_url": "https://www.hotspawn.com/valorant/news/jemkin-interview-vct-pacific-stage-2",
            "query_players": [
