            "article_id": "d7c258b4569d2e3a",
            "title": "Here’s The Full List Of Nominees For The Game Awards 2025 - Forbes",
            "published_at": "Thu, 11 Dec 2025 08:00:00 GMT",
            "source": "Forbes",
            "google_news_url": "https://news.google.com/rss/articles/CBMivgFBVV95cUxPV1ZhSHQ4d21NYVFYSkdxREZYekdzYVUxX2J2VlZIeGg2REpuMTAtWGpJMFdQbHk0dTlXSm1YbUctM0VfdzFkOGk0RnVDZ0otWkNFNFpRd0Zma2RIZGVPUzZlNGh0eFJOTVlMZFI2NGxJLWpBbXUwM0drZngxUmtkQ1RKRWNqb1c5ajlPNno1R3dFX2RlLWphOGNUblJad0Uyb3BPMU9ITl9fSkZlMEk2WGx5TGg5NlA2d3RNUWJ3?oc=5",
            "article_url": "https://www.forbes.com/sites/paultassi/2025/12/11/heres-the-full-nominee-list-for-the-game-awards-2025-in-all-categories/",
            "query_players": [
