            "article_id": "be5fd15bcdb73f6d",
            "title": "Saadhak: “Some things are starting to click” but KC not reached final potential – EWC VALORANT 2025 Interview - Hotspawn",
            "published_at": "Thu, 10 Jul 2025 07:00:00 GMT",
            "source": "Hotspawn",
            "google_news_url": "https://news.google.com/rss/articles/CBMieEFVX3lxTFBmdXpqRGgxb1dIa1VKVlAxSURoalQ4T3hJdU4wX1NzOXpVc1pxVDJxdFBsZ21wNTUzMnBaRWhtcXlkN0hVSHdZQUd3Z0dHTDFDcjlITXVIYXdLa0VNTF8zclhEdDNlY0RpWDVMQy1ta1VEZTk2ZEk5Vw?oc=5",
            "article_url": "https://www.hotspawn.com/valorant/news/saadhak-ewc-valorant-interview",
            "query_players": [
                "saadhak"
            ],
            "matched_players": [
                "aspas",
                "Boaster",
                "Click",
                "Derke",
                "heat",
                "Less",
                "Life",
                "Meteor",
                "pANcada",
                "saadhak",
                "something",
                "t3xture",
                "YOU"
            ],
            "content": "An opening win against G2 was the perfect start for Karmine Corp at the Esports World Cup, however defeat to Masters Toronto winners Paper Rex meant that their third matchup was a must-win. The French organisation was able to stave off elimination through a tricky 2-1 win over Bilibili Gaming. Hotspawn spoke to KC IGL Matias “Saadhak” Delipetro for an interview after his side moved on to the EWC VALORANT playoffs.\nSaadhak: It’s been an interesting event. It’s a different country. And the thing that I would say affects me the most is the heat. It’s so hot in here. Wow, guys, you have no idea how hot it is outside. And sometimes we have to move in between buildings and it’s like: “Oh my God”.\nOther than that, it’s been amazing. The players lounge, the PCs, the setup, it’s been really good. And the crowd, of course.\nKC are now seeing some success this year with your EWC run so far.\nI would say: not really. But there’s some things that are starting to click for us that is making the difference, for sure. But I would say no, not 100%.\nOf course, we have to talk about the obvious team. It has to be Paper Rex right now. And Fnatic is in a super good shape, but I wouldn’t even put down NRG or BBL. These teams are really, really strong.\nAnd for sure, I’m forgetting more teams. I think EDG is amazing. Of course Gen.G is an amazing team. But yeah, you can see there’s so much talent and it’s going to be so hard to win. But that’s what makes it beautiful to win also, you know, because all of these teams are so, so strong.\nAs a French org, surely reaching VALORANT Champions in Paris would be a huge achievement for KC.\nI would say: “Yes, 100%”. Because if we start winning and winning and winning, we build that momentum. And at the same time, it’s going to give us confidence:\n“OK, guys, we’re actually insane players.”\n“We actually can reach further in tournaments.”\n“We can actually win.”\nAnd for us, that is super important. And if we can carry this momentum to Stage 2, that would be insane, to be honest.\nI would say it was more of a personal standpoint because I wanted to change something in myself. I wanted to change my environment. I don’t like to be in the same place forever because I feel like changes are important in life. And after having this opportunity from KC, for me, it was obvious, I had to go there. It was more like, they were showing me that they’re willing to change for me, to accommodate me, to accommodate my family, even. So for me it was like: “Okay, yes, I have to go there”. They are insane. The administration is really good, the players. I went also because of Engh, because I really admire him as a coach.\nI would say the map is really, really interesting because it’s kind of like a short mid. So you have this scrimmage, fight, these 1v1s, 2v2s, so we reveal and, blah, blah, blah.\nThose types of maps, I love them. I love them because they’re short mid, so it means fights and it means like you can either split A super fast or you can do a bunch of different plays. So, so far, yeah, I’m not going to go into too many details, but it’s feeling super nice, super nice to play. It’s feeling, at least for me, natural. So yeah, yeah, I really like Corrode.\nVALORANT GOAT for me: FNS, 100%. We went head-to-head: he destroyed me a couple of times, I destroyed him a couple of times. But at the same time, I still think he’s an insane player.\nTop 10 players, ooh, you got me on that one bro. Without order, I will start with the Brazilians. Of course, my really good friend Less, I would put there. Aspas, of course, insane player. All the people that won Champs: pANcada, Sacy, me — I would even put myself in my top 10.\nThen I would say, oof, so many people. I would put Boaster, I would put Derke, KangKang, so many- t3xture, you know, like so many people- Meteor. So many people I would put in the top 10. So I don’t know. I can go on and on and on and on.\nNo, not really. I think I’ve been long enough to play against everyone I wanted to play against. But it’s good to see new talents coming up. Like you see NRG with these new talents, you see BBL with these new talents. So yeah, 100% I’m super down to face them and have fun.",
            "content_length": 4184
        },
        {
            "article_id": "0de08e7063ccdb4d",
            "title": "\"VALORANT\" Season 2025 // Act II Kicks Off! Will the Battlefield Change with the Appearance of New Agent \"Waylay\" from Thailand!? - Saiga NAK",
            "published_at": "Thu, 06 Mar 2025 08:00:00 GMT",
            "source": "Saiga NAK",
            "google_news_url": "https://news.google.com/rss/articles/CBMiYEFVX3lxTE5LcEJQTGs4VjQzcVZjYnI5V1E5SFhCa3NEaGZWdXBFbTY4dEdUeDkwX2Rtdk5pRW1yVW9zSzg3ckNIbnJrWDNKS0l5MjRHdkZPMjJkVjdRVUNIWkF6OXBtadIBZkFVX3lxTFBwYTI1STU3SFI3c19DODZ5eW5ObnpBZy14c3dDaHFaUEl6U2l4VXF1QWxTMEtLZDByLTVVOXBaUHRKZXpDOUJRV1JBS3JQMEt0VVh6TXk5Yl83ZXd6V2xDdEhMamNEdw?oc=5",
            "article_url": "https://saiganak.com/news/valorant-season2025-act2/",
            "query_players": [
                "Kicks"
            ],
            "matched_players": [
                "Kicks"
            ],
            "content": "Riot Games announced that the new season of the popular tactical FPS \"VALORANT\", \"Season 2025 // Act II\", began on Thursday, March 6, 2025.\nFurthermore, the highly anticipated new agent \"Waylay\" has been implemented, drawing attention.\nWho is the New Agent \"Waylay\" Who Manipulates Light?\n\"Waylay,\" a Duelist from Thailand, is an agent who races through the battlefield at the speed of light, utilizing the power of prisms.\nShe possesses unique skills that allow her to unleash shards of light, disrupt enemies, and instantly return to a safe location.\nDevelopers Talk About \"Waylay\"'s Tactical Role\nAccording to Game Designer June Cuervo, \"Waylay\" was designed as a Duelist highly skilled in securing areas, and her characteristics below, in particular, give her a unique presence...\n- \"Refract\": The ability to safely retreat after a dash\n- A skill set that combines mobility and aggressiveness\n- Movement that reliably secures kills in conjunction with allies' utility\nCuervo described that her playstyle offers high freedom and allows for creative tactics, and that she will likely become an agent who spearheads the team as the starting point of offense.\"\nNew Skin Series \"Cylax\" and Battle Pass Also Appear!\nThe new weapon skin collection \"Cylax\" will also be released starting Friday, March 7, 2025.\nThis skin features a design themed around the mysteries of space, and includes items for the Vandal, Ghost, Guardian, Stinger, and the melee weapon \"Fanblade.\"\nFurthermore, the new Battle Pass also includes gear that expresses players' individuality, such as \"Tactibear Flex\" and \"Doomwing Phantom\"!\nNew Season \"Season 2025 // Act II\" Begins on March 6!\n新たなデュエリスト「ウェイレイ」が登場 pic.twitter.com/mnBZTEoWUE\n— VALORANT // JAPAN (@VALORANTjp) March 5, 2025\n\"VALORANT\" continues to evolve as a highly competitive FPS loved by players worldwide, supporting not only PC but also PlayStation 5 and Xbox Series X|S.\nWhat kind of changes will occur on the battlefield with the appearance of the new agent \"Waylay\"?\nLet's play and find out!\nCheck the \"VALORANT\" official website, official X (@VALORANTjp), official TikTok (playvalorantjp), and more for the latest information!",
            "content_length": 2168
        },
