            "title": "Paper Rex can finally lift up a trophy as they become the Masters of Toronto - App Trigger",
            "published_at": "Sun, 29 Jun 2025 07:00:00 GMT",
            "source": "App Trigger",
            "google_news_url": "https://news.google.com/rss/articles/CBMisgFBVV95cUxOQmdDUnBmcFEzbUxLNjBmVFpmTTJFclA1MmwtTzJ6ZmdkV0c3RFhvWEpzYzN4OXdDYjlkRXU2ZXpfaC0xczhYZ0pZeTNhcHNfMWpCVUE5Y1VUbUZmQzg5QldxcFdDeEpicjdaRmRHWVZHOXhYOVJPd1RDMy1xVmVkX0Vac1YwdGR4MEY1aDhIVU1rTkt2Nk9sT0F4Z18zaUVyWDc1b2NXQWlFM00zN29IQUZn?oc=5",
            "article_url": "https://apptrigger.com/paper-rex-can-finally-lift-up-a-trophy-as-they-become-the-masters-of-toronto-01jytgy53xsz",
            "query_players": [
