            "content": "This is the home of the best players in the world. The most successful region ever. Welcome to the VCT Americas 2025 Awards. This season had everything: big wins, nail-biting rounds, and surprises left and right. New rivalries got spicy, new talent stepped up huge, a few favorites slipped, and by the end, G2 closed an amazing year, dominating the region and claiming their third regional championship. Meanwhile, NRG went on a wild run and straight up conquered the world at Champions Paris. A season we won’t forget.\nIt’s important for us to celebrate the players and coaches who pushed the region forward and delivered some of the strongest performances from a region in VCT history.\nAnd with that, we’re excited to share the VCT Americas 2025 Season Awards!\nMiBR aspas\nMiBR aspas - 75 Points\nRunners-Up\nNRG brawk - 45 Points\nNRG mada - 38 Points\nNRG Bonkar\nNRG bonkar - 117 Points\nRunners-Up\nG2 JoshRT - 79 Points\nMiBR fRoD - 48 Points\nNRG Ethan\nNRG Ethan - 126 Points\nRunners-Up\nG2 valyn - 105 Points\nMiBR Verno - 40 Points\nG2 valyn\nG2 valyn - 104 Points\nRunners-Up\nNRG s0m - 95 Points\nSEN bang - 25Points\nMiBR aspas\nMiBR aspas - 100 Points\nRunners-Up\nNRG mada - 94 Points\nG2 jawgemo - 35 Points\nNRG brawk\nNRG brawk - 89 Points\nRunners-Up\nG2 trent - 64 Points\nNRG Ethan - 55 Points\nG2 leaf\nG2 leaf - 100 Points \nRunners-Up\nMiBR cortezia - 76 Points\nNRG skuba - 68 Points\nMiBR cortezia\nMiBR cortezia - 37 Points \nRunners-Up\nNRG brawk - 33 Points\nLEV Sato - 30 Points\nNRG brawk\nNRG brawk - 71 Points\nRunners-Up\nNRG mada - 69 Points\nLEV Sato - 54 Points",
