            "content": "NAVI VALORANT player Uğur «Ruxic» Güç has been named EMEA Controller of the Year. The nomination results were published by the official VALORANT Esports regional account.\nIn the race for the best controller title, Ruxic placed ahead of Keiko (NRG), PROFEK (Vitality), and Boaster (Fnatic), who took second through third positions, respectively.\nWe congratulate Uğur on his incredible performance throughout 2025 as we look forward to the start of the new season. We are confident that Ruxic will continue to excite fans with beautiful highlights and help the team qualify for Champions.",
