            "content": "VALORANT at EWC 25 Winners: Team Heretics Reverse Sweep\nJul 13, 2025.\nAfter a thrilling five-game series, Team Heretics are the VALORANT at Esports World Cup 2025 winners. The Ričardas \"Boo\" Lukaševičius-led squad took out Fnatic in a breathtaking reverse sweep to claim the inaugural title. Congratulations to Team Heretics on taking home the VALORANT at EWC trophy and $500,000 in prize money.",
