            "content": "The VLRNT // FRGMT Collection\nTo celebrate VALORANT Champions Paris, we teamed up with fragment, helmed by Hiroshi Fujiwara (@fujiwarahiroshi), on a limited-edition merch collection and in-game bundle.\nPick up a tee, jersey, hoodie, sweatpants, cap, field jacket, keychain, and a Wingman plush that comes with a hyper-exclusive in-game Gun Buddy (you know it’s lil’ bro).\nCOLLECTION LINEUP\nVLRNT // FRGMT Short Sleeve Tees\nGaming and fashion fundamentals. Custom reactive-dyed, 260 gsm 100% cotton jersey construction.\nVLRNT // FRGMT Hockey Jersey\nWhether you’re on ice[box] and off. 250 gsm 100% polyester with direct embroidered VLRNT // FRGMT patches.\nVLRNT // FRGMT Hoodie\nChampions wardrobe essential. Heavyweight 100% cotton French terry pullover with reflective screenprinting.\nVLRNT // FRGMT Sweatpants\nComfy bottoms for top fragging. Pair with the VLRNT // FRGMT hoodie for a full 100% cotton French terry set.\nVLRNT // FRGMT Field Jacket\nLightweight util for all conditions. 155 gsm 100% nylon shell with TPU backing and a packable hood.\nVLRNT // FRGMT Cap\nDinked, but not down. Custom 100% twill cotton 6 panel cap.\nVLRNT // FRGMT WNGMN Keychain Plush\nHe's the lil' bro with the biggest drip >v< Measures approx 5 in / 13 cm tall by 3.5 in / 9 cm wide.\nVLRNT // FRGMT WNGMN Plush\nTake a lil’ something back into the game. The VLRNT // FRGMT Wingman Plush comes with an exclusive in-game FRGMT x WNGMN+ Gun Buddy (more on that below…).\nWHERE TO COP\nThe merch collection will be available to purchase:\nONLINE\nIn North America and Europe at https://merch.riotgames.com, in South Korea at https://kream.co.kr/exhibitions/12197, in Japan at https://riotstore.jp, and in China across Riot Games’ Tmall, JDG, Douyin, and VALORANT Merch Mall starting September 29 @ 6AM PT.\nIRL\nWith limited availability on-site at Champions Paris Finals weekend at the Accor Arena (first floor main retail shop) from October 3-5 from 0:00-0:00.\nAt the VALORANT // FRGMT Pop-Up in Paris:\n- October 2-5: 14:00 - 21:00 \n- October 6: 11:00 - 18:00 \n- Address: 23 Rue du Sentier, Paris 75002 \nIN-GAME\nEven if you’re not looking to kit out your collection in the flesh, we’ve got something for you in the in-game shop: the FRGMT x WNGMN Gun Buddy and WNGMN title.\nLet’s get exclusive: FRGMT x WNGMN+ Gun Buddy\nA hyper-exclusive gun buddy only available with purchase of the VLRNT // FRGMT WNGMN Plushie.\nEach VLRNT // FRGMT WNGMN Plush comes with an item tag featuring a redemption code. Here’s how to redeem:\n- Scratch off the silver bar at the bottom of the hang tag to reveal your unique code \n- Head to the Riot Code Redemption page on your browser of choice \n- Enter the code in the window exactly as it appears on the hang tag, then select \"Redeem Code\" \nDISCLAIMER\n- Limit one FRGMT x WNGMN+ Gun Buddy per Riot ID \n- This item is not subject to returns or refunds \n- Riot is not responsible for discarded hang tags \nNote: If you have any issues redeeming your code, send us a ticket with the following information: the code itself, your Riot ID, the email you used to sign up for your Riot Account.",
