            "article_id": "7dba0109933bb622",
            "title": "The Game Awards announces Game of the Year 2025 nominees - Polygon.com",
            "published_at": "Mon, 17 Nov 2025 08:00:00 GMT",
            "source": "Polygon.com",
            "google_news_url": "https://news.google.com/rss/articles/CBMifEFVX3lxTE0xOVpjWjdyUXpPOFpGWWFvVVJPaVVRbGxCQmhRZFFRcF9sUHQ4enZFWHlZajlGYnBXV1NxQVFweU9PUXE1RDJlSXhyU0FGZFJGcjZMcE9vU0p0MTg2UXFSM0F5V0V3cXNoaldEUjRxT2dKR1JCV2lTQ2NmSGw?oc=5",
            "article_url": "https://www.polygon.com/game-awards-2025-nominees-list-game-of-the-year/",
