            "content": "Week One of the Esports World Cup 2025 has concluded, and the Valorant segment of the seven-week-long event has concluded, crowning Team Heretics the winner after a tumultuous bracket.\nThe Grand Final of the Valorant tournament at the Esports World Cup 2025 came down to Team Heretics and Fnatic, and Team Heretics pulled off a thrilling reverse sweep.\nTeam Heretics had a rough road to the Playoffs Stage. During the team’s Group Stage, it was initially knocked to the Lower Bracket after a loss to NRG. However, it won both its elimination match against Titan Esports Club and its decider match against Rex Regum Qeon.\nThis qualified Team Heretics for the Playoffs Stage, where they triumphed over BBL Esports and Gen.G Esports to go to the Grand Final.\nThe first game, played on Lotus, went 13 to 4 to Fnatic. The team rosters were as follows:\n- Fnatic:\n- Chronicle: Viper\n- Kaajak: Raze\n- Boaster: Omen\n- Alfajar: Killjoy\n- crashies: Fade\n \n- Team Heretics:\n- MiniBoo: Neon\n- RieNs: Breach\n- Boo: Omen\n- benjyfishy: Viper\n- Wo0t: Fade\n \nThe second game was played on Sunset, where Fnatic won 13 to 1 over Team Heretics. The team rosters were as follows:\n- Fnatic:\n- Chronicle: Cypher\n- Kaajak: Yoru\n- Boaster: Omen\n- Alfajar: Neon\n- crashies: Sova\n \n- Team Heretics:\n- MiniBoo: Neon\n- RieNs: Sova\n- Boo: Omen\n- benjyfishy: Vyse\n- Wo0t: KAY/O\n \nAt this point, Team Heretics took control back and fought hard for their Grand Final win. The third round went to Team Heretics in a 13-11 win on Icebox with a roster as follows:\n- Fnatic:\n- Chronicle: Sage\n- Kaajak: Jett\n- Boaster: Viper\n- Alfajar: Killjoy\n- crashies: Sova\n \n- Team Heretics:\n- MiniBoo: Omen\n- RieNs: Sova\n- Boo: Viper\n- benjyfishy: Killjoy\n- Wo0t: KAY/O\n \nFrom there, Team Heretics won again in a 13-10 win on Haven with the following roster:\n- Fnatic:\n- Chronicle: Vyse\n- Kaajak: Yoru\n- Boaster: Astra\n- Alfajar: Chamber\n- crashies: Sova\n \n- Team Heretics:\n- MiniBoo: Yoru\n- RieNs: Sova\n- Boo: Omen\n- benjyfishy: Cypher\n- Wo0t: Iso\n \nFinally, the two teams ended on Ascent, where Team Heretics continued fighting and ultimately won 13-10 with the following roster:\n- Fnatic:\n- Chronicle: Vyse\n- Kaajak: Yoru\n- Boaster: Omen\n- Alfajar: Chamber\n- crashies: Sova\n \n- Team Heretics:\n- MiniBoo: Yoru\n- RieNs: Sova\n- Boo: Omen\n- benjyfishy: Cypher\n- Wo0t: Jett\n \nFans can watch the entire Valorant Grand Final at the Esports World Cup 2025 below:\nFor more on the Esports World Cup 2025 results, check out the Fatal Fury: City of the Wolves winner, Goichi, and the Team Redline win during the Rennsport Championship.",
