            "article_id": "2bae9d64cdca96de",
            "title": "PatMen: “It was really hard to adapt to four guys… I just tried to vibe with them” – EWC VALORANT Interview - Hotspawn",
            "published_at": "Mon, 14 Jul 2025 07:00:00 GMT",
            "source": "Hotspawn",
            "google_news_url": "https://news.google.com/rss/articles/CBMid0FVX3lxTE1IX011b2ZkZWZpODFVZXdvRVdBQmxtaVNKV3lxU3dSZkYxVDFWTm1tdXIyVzBWM05qaFNZaFNNUlNfcHlWVkxxX3ROUE41ODFrWDNxXzhERnJCYWo0cnFCMG1CNERiaWlVdzVRYzVCaEJZdW1MTXVJ?oc=5",
            "article_url": "https://www.hotspawn.com/valorant/news/patmen-ewc-valorant-interview",
            "query_players": [
