            "article_id": "b119d514f49f6e0a",
            "title": "DRX vs. T1 to Kick Off Valorant VCT Pacific Mid-Season Playoffs - Inven Global",
            "published_at": "Fri, 25 Apr 2025 07:00:00 GMT",
