            "article_id": "9c08cdd41d0544dd",
            "title": "f0rsakeN: “You can maybe consider Paper Rex the best” AFTER winning Champs – EWC VALORANT Interview - Hotspawn",
            "published_at": "Fri, 11 Jul 2025 07:00:00 GMT",
            "source": "Hotspawn",
            "google_news_url": "https://news.google.com/rss/articles/CBMiekFVX3lxTFBOS21iVy1sV3pxd3NxZEhRVEtFN0g5UlFJS3JjMWtTQ3M5THlaTzBjODIwUXd5cGNOUm4zRnQxaGYzODMwRGVveEJrTTQ5THlwS3NoeXpVMzdDZzVKUC01Q3NEWHg3MTFfSUY1NFA2bG9kME1XTFN2NGJR?oc=5",
            "article_url": "https://www.hotspawn.com/valorant/news/f0rsaken-ewc-valorant-interview",
            "query_players": [
